                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "227012842",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198079769024",
                            "num_reviews": 1,
                            "playtime_forever": 1413,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 1210,
                            "last_played": 1780859706
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I've played Caveman Craig and the Special Edition. This is a very fun game and I am happy to see it continue to grow. \r\n\r\nSome improvements:\r\n1) Hunter AI is not very helpful and will often stand still when they are needed to attack. The AI in the original games would immediately go to a dinosaur on screen.\r\n2) The rock-throwing physics is awful. Please change this to either make it able to be aimed with the mouse or something similar. The target is useful in theory, but irritating in practice.\r\n3) Maybe I haven't seen it yet, but please add a mode that is more of a sandbox or open-ended creation of a community.\r\n\r\nOverall, a great game with some minor corrections. For the price, I would recommend buying the game.",
